{"title":"Gold Fittings","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Carpentry Lv 30)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Carpentry at level 30 <span class=\"muted\">(50 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/gold-ore\">Gold Ore</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/carpentry\">Carpentry</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/iron-fittings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/f8c979df6344ede0f746.svg\" alt=\"\">Iron Fittings</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-fittings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/1fdb314593315fdc2ce6.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Fittings</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/titanium-fittings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/8b89af9abdfc90b7af41.svg\" alt=\"\">Titanium Fittings</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-ore\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/96ac4c0c00408050248e.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Ore</a></p>\n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-bucket\">Black Walnut Bucket</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Carpentry 30</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-storage-chest\">Black Walnut Storage Chest</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Carpentry 54</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-bed\">Black Walnut Bed</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Carpentry 59</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-stone-hearth\">Black Walnut Stone Hearth</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Carpentry 41</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-scribes-lectern\">Black Walnut Scribes Lectern</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Carpentry 44</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-pestle-and-mortar\">Black Walnut Pestle And Mortar</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Carpentry 46</spa